n v8.16.2, making the limit configuration in docker-elk unnecessary.\r\n- The Elastic Agent image is now `docker.elastic.co/elastic-agent/elastic-agent` instead of the (soon deprecated) `docker.elastic.co/beats/elastic-agent` image.", "reactions": {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/deviantony/docker-elk/releases/210654088/reactions", "total_count": 3, "+1": 1, "-1": 0, "laugh": 0, "hooray": 1, "confused": 0, "heart": 0, "rocket": 1, "eyes": 0}}, {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/deviantony/docker-elk/releases/177789791", "assets_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/deviantony/docker-elk/releases/177789791/assets", "upload_url": "https://uploads.github.com/repos/deviantony/docker-elk/releases/177789791/assets{?name,label}", "html_url": "https://github.com/deviantony/docker-elk/releases/tag/8.2410.1", "id": 177789791, "author": {"login": "antoineco", "id": 3299086, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjMyOTkwODY=", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3299086?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/antoineco", "html_url": "https://github.com/antoineco", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/antoineco/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/antoineco/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/antoineco/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/antoineco/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/antoineco/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/antoineco/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/antoineco/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/antoineco/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/antoineco/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "node_id": "RE_kwDOAZlbsM4KmNtf", "tag_name": "8.2410.1", "target_commitish": "main", "name": "", "draft": false, "immutable": false, "prerelease": false, "created_at": "2024-10-01T12:23:58Z", "updated_at": "2024-10-07T14:45:48Z", "published_at": "2024-10-01T12:28:51Z", "assets": [], "tarball_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/deviantony/docker-elk/tarball/8.2410.1", "zipball_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/deviantony/docker-elk/zipball/8.2410.1", "body": "Default Elastic version: `8.15.2`\r\n\r\n> **Note**\r\n> _See [version selection](https://github.com/deviantony/docker-elk#version-selection) to run a different version._\r\n\r\n### Notable changes\r\n\r\n- The legacy `docker-compose` standalone (Compose v1) is no longer supported.\r\n- Metricbeat no longer fails to publish monitoring events due to the limit of total fields being exceeded when all default modules are enabled.", "reactions": {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/deviantony/docker-elk/releases/177789791/reactions", "total_count": 2, "+1": 0, "-1": 0, "laugh": 0, "hooray": 0, "confused": 0, "heart": 0, "rocket": 2, "eyes": 0}}, {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/deviantony/docker-elk/releases/175090219", "assets_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/deviantony/docker-elk/releases/175090219/assets", "upload_url": "https://uploads.github.com/repos/deviantony/docker-elk/releases/175090219/assets{?name,label}", "html_url": "https://github.com/deviantony/docker-elk/releases/tag/8.2409.1", "id": 175090219, "author": {"login": "antoineco", "id": 3299086, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjMyOTkwODY=", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3299086?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/antoineco", "html_url": "https://github.com/antoineco", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/antoineco/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/antoineco/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/antoineco/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/antoineco/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/antoineco/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/antoineco/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/antoineco/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/antoineco/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/antoineco/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "node_id": "RE_kwDOAZlbsM4Kb6or", "tag_name": "8.2409.1", "target_commitish": "main", "name": "", "draft": false, "immutable": false, "prerelease": false, "created_at": "2024-09-14T18:41:58Z", "updated_at": "2024-09-19T18:40:00Z", "published_at": "2024-09-14T18:47:05Z", "assets": [], "tarball_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/deviantony/docker-elk/tarball/8.2409.1", "zipball_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/deviantony/docker-elk/zipball/8.2409.1", "body": "Default Elastic version: `8.15.1`\r\n\r\n> **Note**\r\n> _See [version selection](https://github.com/deviantony/docker-elk#version-selection) to run a different version._\r\n\r\n### Notable changes\r\n\r\n- Docker no longer warns about missing default values for build arguments which could result in empty or invalid base image names. The associated build check is [InvalidDefaultArgInFrom](https://docs.docker.com/reference/build-checks/invalid-default-arg-in-from/).", "reactions": {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/deviantony/docker-elk/releases/175090219/reactions", "total_count": 1, "+1": 1, "-1": 0, "laugh": 0, "hooray": 0, "confused": 0, "heart": 0, "rocket": 0, "eyes": 0}}, {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/deviantony/docker-elk/releases/141608732", "assets_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/deviantony/docker-elk/releases/141608732/assets", "upload_url": "https://uploads.github.com/repos/deviantony/docker-elk/releases/141608732/assets{?name,label}", "html_url": "https://github.com/deviantony/docker-elk/releases/tag/8.2402.1", "id": 141608732, "author": {"login": "antoineco", "id": 3299086, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjMyOTkwODY=", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3299086?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/antoineco", "html_url": "https://github.com/antoineco", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/antoineco/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/antoineco/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/antoineco/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/antoineco/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/antoineco/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/antoineco/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/antoineco/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/antoineco/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/antoineco/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "node_id": "RE_kwDOAZlbsM4IcMcc", "tag_name": "8.2402.1", "target_commitish": "main", "name": "", "draft": false, "immutable": false, "prerelease": false, "created_at": "2024-02-12T12:17:54Z", "updated_at": "2024-02-12T12:36:41Z", "published_at": "2024-02-12T12:36:41Z", "assets": [], "tarball_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/deviantony/docker-elk/tarball/8.2402.1", "zipball_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/deviantony/docker-elk/zipball/8.2402.1", "body": "Default Elastic version: `8.12.1`\r\n\r\n> **Note**\r\n> _See [version selection](https://github.com/deviantony/docker-elk#version-selection) to run a different version._\r\n\r\n### Notable changes\r\n\r\n- The Fleet Server agent now has the [Docker integration](https://docs.elastic.co/en/integrations/docker) enabled by default, and collects the logs and metrics of all containers running on the host. This mirrors the default behaviour of the Metricsbeat and Filebeat extensions, making them obsolete for the aforementioned purpose.", "reactions": {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/deviantony/docker-elk/releases/141608732/reactions", "total_count": 4, "+1": 0, "-1": 0, "laugh": 0, "hooray": 0, "confused": 0, "heart": 4, "rocket": 0, "eyes": 0}}, {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/deviantony/docker-elk/releases/101755479", "assets_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/deviantony/docker-elk/releases/101755479/assets", "upload_url": "https://uploads.github.com/repos/deviantony/docker-elk/releases/101755479/assets{?name,label}", "html_url": "https://github.com/deviantony/docker-elk/releases/tag/8.2305.1", "id": 101755479, "author": {"login": "antoineco", "id": 3299086, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjMyOTkwODY=", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3299086?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/antoineco", "html_url": "https://github.com/antoineco", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/antoineco/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/antoineco/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/antoineco/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/antoineco/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/antoineco/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/antoineco/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/antoineco/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/antoineco/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/antoineco/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "node_id": "RE_kwDOAZlbsM4GEKpX", "tag_name": "8.2305.1", "target_commitish": "main", "name": "", "draft": false, "immutable": false, "prerelease": false, "created_at": "2023-05-03T16:48:22Z", "updated_at": "2023-05-03T16:59:16Z", "published_at": "2023-05-03T16:59:16Z", "assets": [], "tarball_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/deviantony/docker-elk/tarball/8.2305.1", "zipball_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/deviantony/docker-elk/zipball/8.2305.1", "body": "Default Elastic version: `8.7.1`\r\n\r\n> **Note**\r\n> _See [version selection](https://github.com/deviantony/docker-elk#version-selection) to run a different version._\r\n\r\n### Notable changes\r\n\r\n- The `setup` container must now be run manually with `docker-compose up setup`. This makes the process of initializing users and groups more explicit, and allows re-initializing built-in users and groups with less effort. Please refer to #798 for more information.\r\n- The minimum Compose version requirement was increased to `1.28.0`.\r\n- The `curator` extension was updated to v8.0. Curator is now major version locked with Elasticsearch. Please refer to the [Curator Reference](https://www.elastic.co/guide/en/elasticsearch/client/curator/8.0/versions.html) for more information.", "reactions": {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/deviantony/docker-elk/releases/101755479/reactions", "total_count": 2, "+1": 2, "-1": 0, "laugh": 0, "hooray": 0, "confused": 0, "heart": 0, "rocket": 0, "eyes": 0}}, {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/deviantony/docker-elk/releases/92546078", "assets_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/deviantony/docker-elk/releases/92546078/assets", "upload_url": "https://uploads.github.com/repos/deviantony/docker-elk/releases/92546078/assets{?name,label}", "html_url": "https://github.com/deviantony/docker-elk/releases/tag/8.2302.1", "id": 92546078, "author": {"login": "antoineco", "id": 3299086, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjMyOTkwODY=", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3299086?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/antoineco", "html_url": "https://github.com/antoineco", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/antoineco/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/antoineco/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/antoineco/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/antoineco/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/antoineco/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/antoineco/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/antoineco/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/antoineco/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/antoineco/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "node_id": "RE_kwDOAZlbsM4FhCQe", "tag_name": "8.2302.1", "target_commitish": "main", "name": "", "draft": false, "immutable": false, "prerelease": false, "created_at": "2023-02-17T08:29:55Z", "updated_at": "2023-02-17T11:19:35Z", "published_at": "2023-02-17T08:31:06Z", "assets": [], "tarball_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/deviantony/docker-elk/tarball/8.2302.1", "zipball_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/deviantony/docker-elk/zipball/8.2302.1", "body": "Default Elastic version: `8.6.2`\r\n\r\n> **Note**\r\n> _See [version selection](https://github.com/deviantony/docker-elk#version-selection) to run a different version._\r\n\r\n### Notable changes\r\n\r\n- Elasticsearch, Logstash and Kibana now use the `unless-stopped` [restart policy](https://docs.docker.com/config/containers/start-containers-automatically/) by default. As a result, their respective container gets restarted automatically after exiting, including after a reboot of the Docker host (but _not_ when stopped manually with `docker-compose [stop|down]`).\r\n- Fix Fleet Server extension listening on `127.0.0.1` (localhost) instead of `0.0.0.0` after upgrading to v8.6.\r\n\r\n![restart-policy](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/3299086/219631688-c7c512db-c779-4edd-b38e-9672483e1246.png)\r\n![restart](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/3299086/219635921-1d6913d8-660b-4664-82bb-21714d32a6bc.png)"}, {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/deviantony/docker-elk/releases/84264538", "assets_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/deviantony/docker-elk/releases/84264538/assets", "upload_url": "https://uploads.github.com/repos/deviantony/docker-elk/releases/84264538/assets{?name,label}", "html_url": "https://github.com/deviantony/docker-elk/releases/tag/8.2212.1", "id": 84264538, "author": {"login": "antoineco", "id": 3299086, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjMyOTkwODY=", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3299086?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/antoineco", "html_url": "https://github.com/antoineco", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/antoineco/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/antoineco/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/antoineco/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/antoineco/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/antoineco/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/antoineco/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/antoineco/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/antoineco/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/antoineco/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "node_id": "RE_kwDOAZlbsM4FBcZa", "tag_name": "8.2212.1", "target_commitish": "main", "name": "", "draft": false, "immutable": false, "prerelease": false, "created_at": "2022-12-06T11:33:59Z", "updated_at": "2022-12-06T11:35:07Z", "published_at": "2022-12-06T11:35:07Z", "assets": [], "tarball_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/deviantony/docker-elk/tarball/8.2212.1", "zipball_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/deviantony/docker-elk/zipball/8.2212.1", "body": "Default Elastic version: `8.5.2`\r\n\r\n> **Note**\r\n> _See [version selection](https://github.com/deviantony/docker-elk#version-selection) to run a different version._\r\n\r\n### Notable changes\r\n\r\n- Beats extensions no longer authenticate as the `elastic` superuser to send data to Elasticsearch. Instead, passwords for the `filebeat_internal`, `metricbeat_internal` and `heartbeat_internal` users (inactive by default) must be set respectively in the `.env` file.\r\n- Monitoring of Elasticsearch, Logstash and Kibana is enabled by default via the Metricbeat extension. A password for the `monitoring_internal` user (inactive by default) must be set in the `.env` file for this to work.\r\n- Self-monitoring is enabled by default in all Beats extensions. A password for the `beat_system` user (inactive by default) must be set in the `.env` file for this to work.\r\n- Instructions for [re-executing the setup](https://github.com/deviantony/docker-elk/tree/8.2212.1#how-to-re-execute-the-setup) were added. This allows resetting passwords to the values defined in the `.env` file, and forcing the creation of missing internal users and roles.\r\n- It is no longer required to rebuild the image of the `setup` container when switching between the `main` and `tls` branches.\r\n\r\n![stack-monitoring](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/3299086/202710574-32a3d419-86ea-4334-b6f7-62d7826df18d.png\r\n\"Stack Monitoring\")\r\n![host-dashboard](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/3299086/202710594-0deccf40-3a9a-4e63-8411-2e0d9cc6ad3a.png\r\n\"Host Overview Dashboard\")"}, {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/deviantony/docker-elk/releases/83380535", "assets_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/deviantony/docker-elk/releases/83380535/assets", "upload_url": "https://uploads.github.com/repos/deviantony/docker-elk/releases/83380535/assets{?name,label}", "html_url": "https://github.com/deviantony/docker-elk/releases/tag/8.2211.1", "id": 83380535, "author": {"login": "antoineco", "id": 3299086, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjMyOTkwODY=", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3299086?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/antoineco", "html_url": "https://github.com/antoineco", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/antoineco/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/antoineco/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/antoineco/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/antoineco/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/antoineco/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/antoineco/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/antoineco/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/antoineco/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/antoineco/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "node_id": "RE_kwDOAZlbsM4E-Ek3", "tag_name": "8.2211.1", "target_commitish": "main", "name": "", "draft": false, "immutable": false, "prerelease": false, "created_at": "2022-11-17T11:18:35Z", "updated_at": "2022-11-27T14:52:49Z", "published_at": "2022-11-17T11:32:50Z", "assets": [], "tarball_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/deviantony/docker-elk/tarball/8.2211.1", "zipball_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/deviantony/docker-elk/zipball/8.2211.1", "body": "Default Elastic version: `8.5.1`\r\n\r\n> **Note**\r\n> _See [version selection](https://github.com/deviantony/docker-elk#version-selection) to run a different version._\r\n\r\n### Notable changes\r\n\r\n- Addition of the Fleet extension.\r\n- Deletion of the deprecated standalone APM Server extension. APM Server is now deployed as an [Elastic Integration](https://docs.elastic.co/integrations) via Elastic Agent.\r\n\r\n![fleet-agents](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/3299086/202701399-27518fe4-17b7-49d1-aefb-868dffeaa68a.png\r\n\"Fleet Agents\")\r\n![elastic-agent-dashboard](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/3299086/202701404-958f8d80-a7a0-4044-bbf9-bf73f3bdd17a.png\r\n\"Elastic Agent Dashboard\")"}, {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/deviantony/docker-elk/releases/73345834", "assets_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/deviantony/docker-elk/releases/73345834/assets", "upload_url": "https://uploads.github.com/repos/deviantony/docker-elk/releases/73345834/assets{?name,label}", "html_url": "https://github.com/deviantony/docker-elk/releases/tag/8.2208.1", "id": 73345834, "author": {"login": "antoineco", "id": 3299086, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjMyOTkwODY=", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3299086?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/antoineco", "html_url": "https://github.com/antoineco", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/antoineco/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/antoineco/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/antoineco/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/antoineco/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/antoineco/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/antoineco/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/antoineco/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/antoineco/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/antoineco/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "node_id": "RE_kwDOAZlbsM4EXysq", "tag_name": "8.2208.1", "target_commitish": "main", "name": "", "draft": false, "immutable": false, "prerelease": false, "created_at": "2022-08-01T14:08:32Z", "updated_at": "2022-08-01T14:17:37Z", "published_at": "2022-08-01T14:17:37Z", "assets": [], "tarball_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/deviantony/docker-elk/tarball/8.2208.1", "zipball_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/deviantony/docker-elk/zipball/8.2208.1", "body": "Default Elastic version: `8.3.3`\r\n\r\n> **Note**\r\n> _See [version selection](https://github.com/deviantony/docker-elk#version-selection) to run a different version._\r\n\r\n### Notable changes\r\n\r\n- Change the default port of Logstash's TCP input from `5000` to `50000` to avoid conflicts with IANA registered ports (UPnP, Docker Registry, Apple's AirPlay Receiver, ...)"}, {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/deviantony/docker-elk/releases/68532152", "assets_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/deviantony/docker-elk/releases/68532152/assets", "upload_url": "https://uploads.github.com/repos/deviantony/docker-elk/releases/68532152/assets{?name,label}", "html_url": "https://github.com/deviantony/docker-elk/releases/tag/8.2206.1", "id": 68532152, "author": {"login": "antoineco", "id": 3299086, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjMyOTkwODY=", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3299086?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/antoineco", "html_url": "https://github.com/antoineco", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/antoineco/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/antoineco/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/antoineco/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/antoineco/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/antoineco/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/antoineco/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/antoineco/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/antoineco/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/antoineco/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "node_id": "RE_kwDOAZlbsM4EFbe4", "tag_name": "8.2206.1", "target_commitish": "main", "name": "", "draft": false, "immutable": false, "prerelease": false, "created_at": "2022-06-03T14:21:41Z", "updated_at": "2022-06-07T14:45:33Z", "published_at": "2022-06-03T14:23:05Z", "assets": [], "tarball_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/deviantony/docker-elk/tarball/8.2206.1", "zipball_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/deviantony/docker-elk/zipball/8.2206.1", "body": "Default Elastic version: `8.2.2`\r\n\r\n> **Note**\r\n> _See [version selection](https://github.com/deviantony/docker-elk#version-selection) to run a different version._\r\n\r\n### Notable changes\r\n\r\n- Raise JVM heap size of Elasticsearch from 256 MB to 512 MB"}, {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/deviantony/docker-elk/releases/68533612", "assets_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/deviantony/docker-elk/releases/68533612/assets", "upload_url": "https://uploads.github.com/repos/deviantony/docker-elk/releases/68533612/assets{?name,label}", "html_url": "https://github.com/deviantony/docker-elk/releases/tag/8.2203.1", "id": 68533612, "author": {"login": "antoineco", "id": 3299086, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjMyOTkwODY=", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3299086?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/antoineco", "html_url": "https://github.com/antoineco", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/antoineco/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/antoineco/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/antoineco/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/antoineco/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/antoineco/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/antoineco/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/antoineco/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/antoineco/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/antoineco/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "node_id": "RE_kwDOAZlbsM4EFb1s", "tag_name": "8.2203.1", "target_commitish": "main", "name": "", "draft": false, "immutable": false, "prerelease": false, "created_at": "2022-06-03T14:21:19Z", "updated_at": "2022-06-07T14:44:50Z", "published_at": "2022-06-03T14:22:45Z", "assets": [], "tarball_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/deviantony/docker-elk/tarball/8.2203.1", "zipball_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/deviantony/docker-elk/zipball/8.2203.1", "body": "Default Elastic version: `8.0.0`\r\n\r\n> **Note**\r\n> _See [version selection](https://github.com/deviantony/docker-elk#version-selection) to run a different version._\r\n\r\n### Notable changes\r\n\r\n- Introduce the `setup` service to automate the management of required roles and user passwords\r\n- Bump minimum Compose version requirement to `1.26.0`\r\n- Update Compose file version to `3.7`\r\n- Rename `ELK_VERSION` to `ELASTIC_VERSION`"}, {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/deviantony/docker-elk/releases/68533112", "assets_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/deviantony/docker-elk/releases/68533112/assets", "upload_url": "https://uploads.github.com/repos/deviantony/docker-elk/releases/68533112/assets{?name,label}", "html_url": "https://github.com/deviantony/docker-elk/releases/tag/8.2202.1", "id": 68533112, "author": {"login": "antoineco", "id": 3299086, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjMyOTkwODY=", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3299086?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/antoineco", "html_url": "https://github.com/antoineco", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/antoineco/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/antoineco/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/antoineco/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/antoineco/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/antoineco/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/antoineco/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/antoineco/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/antoineco/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/antoineco/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "node_id": "RE_kwDOAZlbsM4EFbt4", "tag_name": "8.2202.1", "target_commitish": "main", "name": "", "draft": false, "immutable": false, "prerelease": false, "created_at": "2022-06-03T14:20:39Z", "updated_at": "2022-11-22T13:39:17Z", "published_at": "2022-06-03T14:22:26Z", "assets": [], "tarball_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/deviantony/docker-elk/tarball/8.2202.1", "zipball_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/deviantony/docker-elk/zipball/8.2202.1", "body": "Default Elastic version: `8.0.0`\r\n\r\n> **Note**\r\n> _See [version selection](https://github.com/deviantony/docker-elk#version-selection) to run a different version._\r\n\r\n### Notable changes\r\n\r\n- The `main` branch now follows the 8.x release series of Elastic components.\r\n\r\n    Moving forward, all changes on the `main` branch should be considered **incompatible** with the 7.x release series, which is now being tracked on the `release-7.x` branch.\r\n\r\nList of changes impacting docker-elk:\r\n\r\n#### Logstash\r\n\r\n- **The output to Elasticsearch is handled as a data stream.**\r\n\r\n  Starting with v8.0.0, the `elasticsearch` output for Logstash sends log data to a data stream instead of `logstash-*` indices by default. The name of the default data stream is `logs-generic-default`. docker-elk remains unopinionated and simply uses Elastic's defaults like it always has, so users who prefer to retain the old behaviour need to explicitly opt-out of data streams in their Logstash pipelines.\r\n\r\n  Refs:\r\n  - https://www.elastic.co/guide/en/elasticsearch/reference/8.0/data-streams.html\r\n  - https://www.elastic.co/guide/en/logstash/8.0/plugins-outputs-elasticsearch.html#plugins-outputs-elasticsearch-data-streams\r\n\r\n- **The (legacy) monitoring data collection is now disabled.**\r\n\r\n  This feature was deprecated since v7.9.0, and removed in v8.0.0.\r\n\r\n  Ref: https://www.elastic.co/guide/en/logstash/8.0/monitoring-internal-collection-legacy.html\r\n\r\n#### Elasticsearch\r\n\r\n- **The command line tool `elasticsearch-setup-passwords` was deprecated in favour of a new `elasticsearch-reset-password` tool.**\r\n\r\n  Passwords for built-in users must now be generated one by one.\r\n\r\n  Ref: https://www.elastic.co/guide/en/elasticsearch/reference/8.0/setup-passwords.html\r\n\r\n#### Kibana\r\n\r\n- **An index pattern for `logs-*` indices is automatically created.**\r\n\r\n  It used to be required to manually create an index pattern for indices managed by Logstash, even when using the default Logstash indices. This is no longer the case since the output data is now being handled as a data stream, and Kibana automatically creates index patterns for these.\r\n\r\n#### Enterprise Search\r\n\r\n- **Kibana is now the new management interface, and the only one available moving forward.**\r\n\r\n  The old standalone Enterprise Search interface was removed in v8.0.0.\r\n\r\n  Ref: https://www.elastic.co/guide/en/enterprise-search/8.0/user-interfaces.html"}], "link": null}